                            <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS14055SaintJ">Jean Saint</persName>. 
                            The manuscripts originated from Šawā (ʾAddis ʾAbabā, Dabra Libānos, Dabra Bǝrhān),
                            Goǧǧām (Dimā Giyorgis, Marṭula Māryām, Dabra Warq) and Bagemdǝr (Gondar, ʾAzazo Takla Hāymānot) and very few from Tǝgrāy.
                        </provenance>
                        <acquisition when="1928">
                            The manuscript entered the library on <date when="1928-04-18">18 April 1928</date>, 
                            at the time of pope <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS7895PiusXI">Pius XI</persName> and the librarian <persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS13926Ehrle">Franz Ehrle</persName>, whose coats of arms are found on the front cover.
                        </acquisition>
